# Cloudflare Pages static headers
#
# These two headers together enable crossOriginIsolated = true in the browser.
# Hard requirement for @webcontainer/api (WebContainers) and Pyodide SABs.
# Mirrors what the Vite dev server sends via vite.config.ts server.headers.
#
# Ref: https://developer.chrome.com/blog/enabling-shared-array-buffer/

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

